        <body>
            <div xml:id="d502">

                <pb facs="0560" n="510" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg510"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McDonald to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-25"><hi rendition="#italic">September 25,
                        1893</hi></date>. (Received November 3.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge your No.
                    13, diplomatic series, replying to Mr. Sperry’s No. 62, concerning the desire of
                    the Persian Government to be represented in the mixed tribunals of Egypt and
                    asking the intervention of the U. S. Government to that end.</p>
                <p>The reason assigned by the Department for declining at present said intervention
                    will be duly communicated to the Persian Government.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alex. McDonald.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
